{"text":"kuruntokai","n":27,"lines":["கன்று முண்ணாது கலத்தினும் படாது","நல்லான் தீம்பால் நிலத்துக் காஅங்","கெனக்கு மாகா தென்னைக்கு முதவாது","பசலை உணீஇயர் வேண்டும்","திதலை அல்குலென் மாமைக் கவினே"],"tr":["kaṉṟu muṇṇātu kalattiṉum paṭātu","nallāṉ tīmpāl nilattuk kāaṅ","keṉakku mākā teṉṉaikku mutavātu","pacalai uṇīiyar vēṇṭum","titalai alkuleṉ māmaik kaviṉē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"pālai","tinai_ta":"பாலை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"வெள்ளிவீதியார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Veḷḷivītiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"nēricai āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"4×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 16, veṇcīr 3"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"āciriyattaḷai 8, veṇṭaḷai 7, kalittaḷai 3"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"கன்று","tr":"kaṉṟu","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கன்","tr":"kaṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"று","tr":"ṟu"}]},{"text":"முண்ணாது","tr":"muṇṇātu","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"முண்","tr":"muṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ணா","tr":"ṇā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]},{"text":"கலத்தினும்","tr":"kalattiṉum","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கலத்","tr":"kalat"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"தினும்","tr":"tiṉum"}]},{"text":"படாது","tr":"paṭātu","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"படா","tr":"paṭā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"நல்லான்","tr":"nallāṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"நல்","tr":"nal"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லான்","tr":"lāṉ"}]},{"text":"தீம்பால்","tr":"tīmpāl","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தீம்","tr":"tīm"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பால்","tr":"pāl"}]},{"text":"நிலத்துக்","tr":"nilattuk","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"நிலத்","tr":"nilat"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"துக்","tr":"tuk"}]},{"text":"காஅங்","tr":"kāaṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"அங்","tr":"aṅ"}]}],[{"text":"கெனக்கு","tr":"keṉakku","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கெனக்","tr":"keṉak"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]},{"text":"மாகா","tr":"mākā","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"}]},{"text":"தென்னைக்கு","tr":"teṉṉaikku","foot":"tēmāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தென்","tr":"teṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னைக்","tr":"ṉaik"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"கு","tr":"ku"}]},{"text":"முதவாது","tr":"mutavātu","foot":"puḷimāṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"முத","tr":"muta"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"வா","tr":"vā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"து","tr":"tu"}]}],[{"text":"பசலை","tr":"pacalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"பச","tr":"paca"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"உணீஇயர்","tr":"uṇīiyar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"உணீ","tr":"uṇī"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"இயர்","tr":"iyar"}]},{"text":"வேண்டும்","tr":"vēṇṭum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வேண்","tr":"vēṇ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டும்","tr":"ṭum"}]}],[{"text":"திதலை","tr":"titalai","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"தித","tr":"tita"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"லை","tr":"lai"}]},{"text":"அல்குலென்","tr":"alkuleṉ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"அல்","tr":"al"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"குலென்","tr":"kuleṉ"}]},{"text":"மாமைக்","tr":"māmaik","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"மா","tr":"mā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"மைக்","tr":"maik"}]},{"text":"கவினே","tr":"kaviṉē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கவி","tr":"kavi"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னே","tr":"ṉē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"கன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"கன்று","lemma":"கன்று","gloss":"calf"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"even"}],"gloss":"even the calf"},{"surface":"உண்ணாது","parts":[{"text":"உண்ணாது","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"without drinking"}],"gloss":"without drinking"},{"surface":"கலத்தினும்","parts":[{"text":"கலத்தினும்","lemma":"கலம்","gloss":"even in the vessel"}],"gloss":"even in the vessel"},{"surface":"படாது","parts":[{"text":"படாது","lemma":"படு","gloss":"without being poured"}],"gloss":"without being poured"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"நல்லான்","parts":[{"text":"நல்லான்","lemma":"நல்லான்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தீம்பால்","parts":[{"text":"தீம்பால்","lemma":"தீம்பால்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"நிலத்துக்","parts":[{"text":"நிலத்துக்","lemma":"நிலத்துக்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"காஅங்","parts":[{"text":"காஅங்","lemma":"காஅங்","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"கெனக்கு","parts":[{"text":"கெனக்கு","lemma":"கெனக்கு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"மாகா","parts":[{"text":"மாகா","lemma":"மாகா","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"தென்னைக்கு","parts":[{"text":"தென்னைக்கு","lemma":"தென்னைக்கு","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"முதவாது","parts":[{"text":"முதவாது","lemma":"முதவாது","gloss":""}],"gloss":"","split_unverified":true}],"as_printed":true},{"words":[{"surface":"பசலை","parts":[{"text":"பசலை","lemma":"பசலை","gloss":"pallor"}],"gloss":"pallor"},{"surface":"உணீஇயர்","parts":[{"text":"உணீஇயர்","lemma":"உண்","gloss":"to consume"}],"gloss":"to consume"},{"surface":"வேண்டும்","parts":[{"text":"வேண்டும்","lemma":"வேண்டு","gloss":"wants"}],"gloss":"wants"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"திதலை","parts":[{"text":"திதலை","lemma":"திதலை","gloss":"beauty spots"}],"gloss":"beauty spots"},{"surface":"அல்குல்","parts":[{"text":"அல்குல்","lemma":"அல்குல்","gloss":"waist"}],"gloss":"waist"},{"surface":"என்","parts":[{"text":"என்","lemma":"என்","gloss":"my"}],"gloss":"my"},{"surface":"மாமை","parts":[{"text":"மாமை","lemma":"மாமை","gloss":"dark complexion"}],"gloss":"dark complexion"},{"surface":"கவினே","parts":[{"text":"கவின்","lemma":"கவின்","gloss":"beauty"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"beauty indeed"}]}],"literal":"Even the calf not drinking, even in the vessel not being poured, / the sweet milk of the good cow, on the ground spilling, / neither becoming of use to me, nor being useful to my husband, / the pallor wants to consume / the beauty of my dark complexion and spotted waist!","translation":"Like the sweet milk of a good cow, which is neither drunk by the calf nor collected in a vessel, but is wasted by spilling on the ground, the beauty of my dark complexion and spotted waist is of no use to me, nor does it benefit my husband; instead, the pallor of separation desires to consume it entirely.","modern":"கன்றும் குடிக்காமல், பாத்திரத்திலும் சேராமல், நல்ல பசுவின் இனிமையான பால் தரையில் கொட்டி வீணாவது போல, என் கணவனுக்கும் உதவாமல், எனக்கும் பயனின்றி, தேமல் படர்ந்த என் அல்குலின் மாமை நிற அழகினைப் பசலை நோய் உண்ண விரும்புகிறது.","explanation":"The heroine speaks to herself or her confidante in deep grief during her husband's absence, which belongs to the Pālai (separation) landscape. She compares her fading youth and beauty to the sweet milk of a good cow that is completely wasted. This milk is neither drunk by the calf nor gathered in a vessel for human consumption, but is simply spilled on the ground. Similarly, because her husband is away, her beauty is of no use to him, nor can she enjoy it herself. Instead, the spreading pallor of separation (pasalai) is eagerly consuming her beautiful dark complexion.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"}}